label OrgasmX (x):
    $ Ba = x + "a"
    $ Bb = x + "b"
    $ Bc = x + "c"
    image OrgasmX:
        Ba with vpunch
        1.0
        Bb with hpunch
        1.0
        Bc with vpunch
    scene OrgasmX with hpunch
    return
